{"type":"standard","title":"John McGuire (Virginia politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John McGuire (Virginia politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q47545631","titles":{"canonical":"John_McGuire_(Virginia_politician)","normalized":"John McGuire (Virginia politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John McGuire (Virginia politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":56372100,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/John_McGuire_119th_Congress.jpg/330px-John_McGuire_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/John_McGuire_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1371661739","tid":"a3d0aa1e-a245-11f1-9817-0aec979c7014","timestamp":"2026-08-27T18:32:21Z","description":"American politician (born 1968)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_McGuire_(Virginia_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_McGuire_(Virginia_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_McGuire_(Virginia_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_McGuire_(Virginia_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_McGuire_(Virginia_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/John_McGuire_(Virginia_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_McGuire_(Virginia_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_McGuire_(Virginia_politician)"}},"extract":"John Joseph McGuire III is an American politician, businessman, and former United States Navy SEAL serving as the U.S. representative for Virginia's 5th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, he previously served in the Virginia Senate from 2024 to 2025 and in the Virginia House of Delegates from 2018 to 2024.","extract_html":"<p><b>John Joseph McGuire III</b> is an American politician, businessman, and former United States Navy SEAL serving as the U.S. representative for Virginia's 5th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, he previously served in the Virginia Senate from 2024 to 2025 and in the Virginia House of Delegates from 2018 to 2024.</p>"}